          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abari kumwe na Adoniya bumvise ivyo, baterwa n’ubwoba bwinshi, barashwiragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Adoniya, kubera gutinya Salomo, aca ariruka afata amahembe y’igicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze umuntu araza abwira Salomo ati: “Adoniya yatinye umwami Salomo, none yafashe amahembe y’igicaniro. Yavuze ati: ‘Umwami Salomo narahire ko aticisha inkota umusavyi wiwe uwu musi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
